{"text":"kuruntokai","n":135,"lines":["வினையே ஆடவர்க் குயிரே வாணுதல்","மனையுறை மகளிர்க் காடவர் உயிரென","நமக்குரைத் தோருந் தாமே","அழாஅல் தோழி அழுங்குவர் செலவே"],"tr":["viṉaiyē āṭavark kuyirē vāṇutal","maṉaiyuṟai makaḷirk kāṭavar uyireṉa","namakkurait tōrun tāmē","aḻāal tōḻi aḻuṅkuvar celavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"பாலைபாடிய பெருங் கடுங்கோ","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Pālaipāṭiya Peruṅ Kaṭuṅkō"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வினையே","tr":"viṉaiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வினை","tr":"viṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]},{"text":"ஆடவர்க்","tr":"āṭavark","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டவர்க்","tr":"ṭavark"}]},{"text":"குயிரே","tr":"kuyirē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குயி","tr":"kuyi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]},{"text":"வாணுதல்","tr":"vāṇutal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணுதல்","tr":"ṇutal"}]}],[{"text":"மனையுறை","tr":"maṉaiyuṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மனை","tr":"maṉai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுறை","tr":"yuṟai"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்க்","tr":"makaḷirk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்க்","tr":"ḷirk"}]},{"text":"காடவர்","tr":"kāṭavar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டவர்","tr":"ṭavar"}]},{"text":"உயிரென","tr":"uyireṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உயி","tr":"uyi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரென","tr":"reṉa"}]}],[{"text":"நமக்குரைத்","tr":"namakkurait","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நமக்","tr":"namak"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குரைத்","tr":"kurait"}]},{"text":"தோருந்","tr":"tōrun","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ருந்","tr":"run"}]},{"text":"தாமே","tr":"tāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]}],[{"text":"அழாஅல்","tr":"aḻāal","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அழா","tr":"aḻā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"}]},{"text":"தோழி","tr":"tōḻi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழி","tr":"ḻi"}]},{"text":"அழுங்குவர்","tr":"aḻuṅkuvar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அழுங்","tr":"aḻuṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவர்","tr":"kuvar"}]},{"text":"செலவே","tr":"celavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செல","tr":"cela"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வினையே","parts":[{"text":"வினை","lemma":"வினை","gloss":"work"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"work indeed"},{"surface":"ஆடவர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆடவர்","lemma":"ஆடவர்","gloss":"men"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to men"},{"surface":"உயிரே","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"life indeed"},{"surface":"வாணுதல்","parts":[{"text":"வாணுதல்","lemma":"வாணுதல்","gloss":"bright forehead"}],"gloss":"bright forehead","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மனையுறை","parts":[{"text":"மனை","lemma":"மனை","gloss":"house"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"dwelling"}],"gloss":"home-dwelling"},{"surface":"மகளிர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to women"},{"surface":"ஆடவர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடவர்","lemma":"ஆடவர்","gloss":"men"}],"gloss":"men"},{"surface":"உயிரென","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"},{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying that"}],"gloss":"are life, saying that"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நமக்கு","parts":[{"text":"நமக்கு","lemma":"நாம்","gloss":"to us"}],"gloss":"to us"},{"surface":"உரைத்தோர்","parts":[{"text":"உரைத்தோர்","lemma":"உரை","gloss":"those who said"}],"gloss":"those who said"},{"surface":"உம்","parts":[{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"also"},{"surface":"தாமே","parts":[{"text":"தாமே","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"himself indeed"}],"gloss":"himself indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அழாஅல்","parts":[{"text":"அழாஅல்","lemma":"அழு","gloss":"do not weep"}],"gloss":"do not weep"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"},{"surface":"அழுங்குவர்","parts":[{"text":"அழுங்குவர்","lemma":"அழுங்கு","gloss":"will call off"}],"gloss":"he will call off"},{"surface":"செலவே","parts":[{"text":"செலவு","lemma":"செலவு","gloss":"journey"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"the journey indeed"}]}],"literal":"Work indeed is life to men, O bright-foreheaded one! / To home-dwelling women, men are life, saying that, / to us, the one who said is he himself. / Do not weep, friend, he will call off his journey.","translation":"Endeavor is the very life of men, and men are the life of women who dwell at home—so he himself told us once, O bright-browed one. Do not weep, my friend, he will surely call off his journey.","modern":"ஒளிரும் நெற்றியை உடையவளே! ஆண்களுக்கு அவர்கள் செய்யும் தொழிலே உயிர் ஆகும்; வீட்டில் வாழும் பெண்களுக்கு அந்த ஆண்களே உயிர் என்று நமக்குச் சொன்னவர் அவரே தான். தோழியே, நீ அழாதே! அவர் தன் பயணத்தைத் தவிர்த்துவிடுவார்.","explanation":"In this Pālai (separation) poem, the confidante comforts the weeping heroine who is distressed by the hero's impending departure to earn wealth. She reminds the heroine of the hero's own past words: while work is the very life of men, husbands are the life of home-dwelling women. Since he knows this truth so well, the confidante reassures her that he will not bear to leave her in grief and will surely cancel his journey. The poem beautifully contrasts the external duty of a man with the internal emotional world of a woman. Key words include 'வினை' (work), 'உயிர்' (life), and 'அழுங்குவர்' (he will call off).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.2],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.9],[3.9,4.9],[4.9,4.93],[4.93,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.3,5.6],[5.6,7.7],[7.7,7.94]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.32],[1.32,1.7],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,3.2],[3.2,3.68],[3.68,3.9],[3.9,4.7],[4.7,5.8],[5.8,5.83],[5.83,5.9],[5.9,5.9],[5.9,5.9],[5.9,5.9],[5.9,9.2]]}}